  = note: an explicit embedding, override, or isolate reorders how the text around it is displayed, so an editor or review can show a condition, ID, or script differently from what the machine executes (Trojan Source, CVE-2021-42574)
  = help: if the character is intended, write it as a character reference such as `&#x202E;`, which XML decodes to the same character and keeps visible; otherwise remove it
  = spec: Unicode Standard Annex #9 §2 Directional Formatting Characters
